{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213410","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213410","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1521341001:0":{"text":"我听到你在哀叹狩猎神的陨落。","source_cn":"我听到你在哀叹狩猎神的陨落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C3013896844D637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521341002:0":{"text":"不是哀叹狩猎神，是哀叹雅库伯尔！","source_cn":"不是哀叹狩猎神，是哀叹雅库伯尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DD2B12A59B21FD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521341003:0":{"text":"狩猎神为了一个呼临人，抛弃雅库伯尔，有什么好哀叹的！","source_cn":"狩猎神为了一个呼临人，抛弃雅库伯尔，有什么好哀叹的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3F459954973BCB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521341004:0":{"text":"呼临人那样恶毒，戕害我们的同胞，害得多少人丧命，还害得神抛弃了我们！","source_cn":"呼临人那样恶毒，戕害我们的同胞，害得多少人丧命，还害得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABCED2ED5D5A0B39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521341005:0":{"text":"真是不可原谅……！","source_cn":"真是不可原谅……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49E4F761E2AB25E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521341006: